[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12720.309, "timestamp": "03:32:00", "text": "大概十点吧？一个小时。不对，一个小时。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12722.95, "timestamp": "03:32:02", "text": "嗯，对，大概。  1小时。你学得越多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12725.349, "timestamp": "03:32:05", "text": "，就越会发现有的是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12730.309, "timestamp": "03:32:10", "text": "时间可以浪费。我希望如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12732.07, "timestamp": "03:32:12", "text": "嗯，这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12735.19, "timestamp": "03:32:15", "text": "所有国家的通病。是啊，伙计。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12736.79, "timestamp": "03:32:16", "text": "事情不会一直这样下去。我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12740.15, "timestamp": "03:32:20", "text": "意思是，谁在听？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12743.03, "timestamp": "03:32:23", "text": "我只是希望我能找到一份好工作，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12746.55, "timestamp": "03:32:26", "text": "然后在这里快乐地生活，这就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12755.75, "timestamp": "03:32:35", "text": "每个在日本的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12758.87, "timestamp": "03:32:38", "text": "外国人的期望和梦想，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12761.11, "timestamp": "03:32:41", "text": "我可以在这里一直生活下去，这里很"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12766.71, "timestamp": "03:32:46", "text": "有趣，很好，而且在某些方面"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12769.429, "timestamp": "03:32:49", "text": "比印度好得多，但我还是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12771.67, "timestamp": "03:32:51", "text": "想念印度。我并不想念印度，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12775.11, "timestamp": "03:32:55", "text": "但我对它的思念反应有点迟钝，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12777.99, "timestamp": "03:32:57", "text": "或者说，也许是因为"}]